                  <div class="content-row crOneColContent" id="para-94">
      
                                                        
                
                


  

<div class="paragraph paragraph--one-col position-relative" id="one_col_94">
  
    
    <div class="para-wrap">
      <div class="container">

                <div class="para-general">
          <h2 class="para-title">About Nilai University</h2><div class="para-body"><p class="text-align-justify">Founded in 1997, Nilai University has been notably excelling generally and especially in teaching &amp; learning. This commitment is proven with being ranked in the 2025 QS World University Rankings: Asia and a 5-Stars ratings in 6 categories awarded by QS University Ratings. This accomplishment undeniably reiterates the University’s strength in competing in a greater league and defies the limit of education that transcends borders. Nilai University also stands as a specialist in a 5-Stars ratings for its Masters of Business Administration programmes, recognized for its world-renowned accreditations, impressive employment rates, and impeccable faculty-student ratio. In the realm of teaching, our commitment to student satisfaction and completion has garnered widespread recognition. Our employability track record is marked by strong endorsements from employers. Nilai University has also been rated as ‘Competitive’ (Berdaya saing) by the Malaysian Ministry of Higher Education for Malaysian Integrated Rating of Higher Education Institutions (SETARA) 2022, due to the exceptional performance in key evaluation areas.</p>

<p class="text-align-justify"><a class="link-arrow" href="/about-us/overview">View More</a></p>

<p class="text-align-justify"><iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="" frameborder="0" height="491" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lK9tpi7Rxgo" title="Nilai University - A one stop haven for you to go out, play, study and live!" width="100%"></iframe></p>
</div>        </div>
        
        
        
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
































        
            </div>
            
    
            
