          <h2 class="para-title">Providing education excellence and enrichment for life</h2><div class="para-body"><p>“For the child… it is not half so important to know as to feel. If facts are the seeds that later produce knowledge and wisdom, then the emotions and the impressions of the senses are the fertile soil in which the seeds must grow.”<br />
