                <div class="para-general">
          <div class="para-body"><div class="cols-2022">
  <div class="col-1-1">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <a href="/scholarship/nilai-care">
        <div class="main-title">Scholarship &amp; Financial</div>
        <div class="teaser">Find out more about scholarships in the form of tuition fee waivers and the ways we help you to relieve your financial stress. </div>
        <div class="link-arrow"></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-2-1">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <a href="/student-life/community">
        <div class="main-title">Robust Campus Life</div>
        <div class="teaser">Each element of the campus is designed with our students in mind. Experience a place full of opportunities, with support you need to achieve excellence!</div>
        <div class="link-arrow"></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-2-2">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <a href="http://crps.nilai.edu.my/crps/">
        <div class="main-title">Research Opportunity</div>
        <div class="teaser">Solve the challenges, find new opportunities. We provide the assistance and facilities you need to complete your research projects. Gain valuable insights while earning course credits. </div>
        <div class="link-arrow"></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-2-3">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <a href="/business-partners">
        <div class="main-title">Industry Collaboration</div>
        <div class="teaser">Explore a new way to achieve mutual benefit, and bring exciting values to the society. Find out how your company can collaborate with us, and how our students can be your potential talent.</div>
        <div class="link-arrow"></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div>        </div>
        
        
        
